    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f741d85730c0a1383791226",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和我一起信奉Shiraoki大人吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d42ba896954f3a541b01c4163c8a6ce8e571258726589d4b84d2537a6e351e09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae2631c2207551e28ed2853f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得，因为遇到了训练员，\r\n才开启了我通往未来的道路……\r\n要好好感谢你和Shiraoki大人才行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c8b33fcbfec367d559272bffd73bffffce252cb7e79a1ae37736164ebe7e70d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc8eafc070ed631f339ca980",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须要用熨斗烫平！\r\n皱皱的可是会沾染邪气的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d22334d0392271d1eb65411280d4d0f1d764ce892377fe3020fa1f18f380e593",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe73c1e0b76b97cbedc7bab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向星星许愿！抓住星星！\r\n这样的祝贺词你觉得怎么样！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc3f89d7de98613a7820a42bfcfcfa25fe79acc81d41d5a0307fde8d2952e3f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5f258800b28b0a19f29e161",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大吉必胜！\r\n完全不觉得自己有输的可能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c22d5bb54351f2e1c4168dd551dff2256fffec646c0dd6ecf2a3a43292376515",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f42e70adaefeb1889b376f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……弄成金色\r\n会不会提升每天的财运呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "397c8210dac848c6c16eeb92393da76cd58a5b416e1259394c78e18c9435704f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe6499fdeb51af57064bdd14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……我的开运道具要装在哪里啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e04cc67c1a335ba95ea59afc79f2e25626255c5088b8c5372c570be44a9c57a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79949323ca4df304b9c9b23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在背后守护我的是Shiraoki大人的使者！\r\n……喵桑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "059fd9b608f5ef389bf73cd64338fe3076f30847a6d6b4cd1acbf40f21f27b64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:055610f28b15a719468c0319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是最强的开运装备！\r\n不怕任何厄运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "348711070c2fa3639ecc6159191fcf2fdbfeefd62978561d8a0fd0376ba92e98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c086d365dc5e39060afa10c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，开运的气势很耀眼吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "309ad723a428d732ca227392601afd5b4cea1d56b63a5c4b3f72e29dd1c0c53d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36e099b2c11ead0c486a4a4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是「大吉」哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79f06acde87fd5dd75b1b77b28835194b2022efd8e081d0c8844ad606117bcdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c619a8397187a3ee994dd6e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开运力量全开！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24f7247877a3e886940a54e4e862828352d846eb36af62e690ffb78aee6646d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0a37eca965f285801202641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的开运穿搭是……这套！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1da65a32782bf491a812fe56e06c16ea6028e72fc8f6cb05237c1dc8022cef0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81647545a7857de66add7894",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定要有一样配件是幸运色，\r\n……这就是幸福的秘诀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85924c28da923092911c88cc8670ff4b9c241053dbddab356f5850da87284777",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
