      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ba25816765c89e10c98a612",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79c32a4e7126b13a2236e6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "開運パワー、全開ですよっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eac683059b7b08cd8825971f9b0d7f495d7f2c5d591795b5b849f7e3b8c832cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "800000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab7070df1cd1e86efb4ec63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼……以为能\r\n赢过有神灵附体的我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0681bd2353ede39c2d58cf7a4d88a1617d9aa7e0cc41b4aca9b2b33e0525c5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99f3235d0f9e8af57a6d0b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这还只是刚开始……！\r\n下次一定会让大家\r\n败在水晶球之下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "122654102d57ca340025ba2a7f029a0faf00b15200f888ffe02c114f4a95935d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74e3232cbb52d2dd88b5aca5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！打招呼顺便帮你\r\n占卜一下今天的运势吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df869537a38fb3a77cff488877f7687a6edc04c1ea7e730f703bbf148b43a436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74b0f471a08acc39cf1dca9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是因为我早上有把\r\n水晶球擦亮的关系吗？\r\n心情觉得特别爽快呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f18bce5ef88ea562886a3107393fff7be72dde46466baeeb73a1eb3343e30f4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8c6ee24bf2642e446cb0a0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了提升今天训练的能力，\r\n吃完午餐后就先去一趟神社吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fdb922b46ece7d3c506ff1316b77f2e253c6dc336ea6218eba2e8a562507a4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b475718df7698d143eca2a4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要和我一起吃午餐吗？\r\n我还可以顺便帮你占卜\r\n今天的幸运食物是什么哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "265858698883e43ce5f5ee433856b587c24a31fd83ae9243838737e23f260e65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d536d0b854fc2480e0b1beed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我建议在枕头下面放三颗糖果哦。\r\n这样会让运气稍～\r\n微变比较好的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5d16505cb35df8777cea82d3aaa79888d4d188d3015a7158fcfcbeeb02014b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
